abstract: "A two-buyer Pareto-optimal allocation with positive utilities has no supporting integrable price. The packet includes the accepted full quantified disproof of the Prove2Me statement, exact-type and axiom audits, pinned reproduction and rejecting controls. Source and platform contributors are credited, and substantial Codex assistance is disclosed. No mathematical novelty or human peer review is claimed."
